   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">The latest update to Revolution R Open, RRO 3.2.1, is <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/download/\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/download/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3B67Sd0Yzz69clRugv0QZd\">now available for download from MRAN</a>. This release upgrades to the latest R engine (3.2.1), enables package downloads via HTTPS by default, and adds new supported Linux platforms.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">You can find the fill list of updates at <a href=\"https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/news/#rro321\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/news/%23rro321&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0zXoq-36JjVzmXG8LtzlQf\">https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/news/#rro321</a> , but in summary Revolution R Open 3.2.1 includes: </p><ul style=\"list-style-position:outside;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><li style=\"margin:5px 10px\">The latest R engine, R 3.2.1. <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/news/#r321\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/news/%23r321&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2xhlJFkxIcO0V-Oho8XLCz\">Improvements</a> in this release include more flexible character string handling, reduced memory usage, and some minor bug fixes.</li><li style=\"margin:5px 10px\"><a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com//documents/rro/multithread/\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com//documents/rro/multithread/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JTHUmtA-ThP2uPAxFkF4E\">Multi-threaded math processing</a>, reducing the time for some numerical operations on multi-core systems.</li><li style=\"margin:5px 10px\">A focus on <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/rro/#reproducibility\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/rro/%23reproducibility&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XEMwi838fDtKZSmdxoL86\">reproducibility</a>, with access to a fixed CRAN snapshot taken on July 1, 2015. Many new and updated packages are available since the previous release of RRO — see the latest <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/spotlight/\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/spotlight/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw06_zIgQKRnq4YMZNs3xgoI\">Package Spotlight</a> for details. CRAN packages released since July 1 can be easily (and reproducibly!) accessed with the <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/reproducibility/#timemachine\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/reproducibility/%23timemachine&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3PUW1qJjIWGhgA97LETJLS\">checkpoint function</a>.</li><li style=\"margin:5px 10px\">Binary downloads for <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/installation/#sysreq\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/rro/installation/%23sysreq&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2hwI-9b8MQ1xz4xtaq0uSU\">Windows, Mac and Linux systems</a>, including new support for <a href=\"https://www.suse.com/products/server/\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.suse.com/products/server/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3t4rl9jpic6o-dcwlfjq8r\">SUSE Linux Enterprise Server</a> 10 and 11, and <a href=\"https://www.opensuse.org/\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.opensuse.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3968awb3dlHYa9uYBxT2Hh\">openSUSE</a> 13.1.</li><li style=\"margin:5px 10px\">100% <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/rro/#compatible\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/rro/%23compatible&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1aNIxCdao2nKTh7fEWjjva\">compatibility</a> with R 3.2.1, RStudio and all other R-based applications.</li></ul><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">You can download Revolution R Open now from the link below, and we welcome comments, suggestions and other discussion here on the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!forum/rropen\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!forum/rropen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3GO1CrFiGqEuFtGuSy52dk\">RRO Google Group</a>. If you&#39;re new to Revolution R Open, here are some <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/getting-started/\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/getting-started/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0bmZmfUZ-3ArX_n2K5jBSY\">tips to get started</a>, and there are many <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/data/\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/data/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1BF-jjnZUIAvFbLj0gzTkJ\">data sources you can explore with RRO</a>. Thanks go as always to the <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/what-is-r/#contributors\" style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:rgb(0,51,102)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/documents/what-is-r/%23contributors&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817620000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2fFp03emI_0VNhGXOCooyH\">contributors to the R Project</a> upon which RRO is built.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\">Enjoy!</p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:&#39;lucida grande&#39;,helvetica,arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px\"># David Smith</p></div>"
    ]
   ]
