     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><a name=\"m_-7106745441220325044__MailEndCompose\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></a></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rro...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rro...@googlegroups.com</a>]\r\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>David Smith<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Thursday, July 23, 2015 9:27 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> Revolution R Open &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rro...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> [RRO] Revolution R Open 3.2.1 now available<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">The latest update to Revolution R Open, RRO 3.2.1, is <a href=\"http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/download/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/download/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241817622000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0iPFaaLmzi54nuKVCTsjKq\"><span style=\"color:#003366\">now available for download\r\n from MRAN</span></a>. This release upgrades to the latest R engine (3.2.1), enables package downloads via HTTPS by default, and adds new supported Linux platforms.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;color:#333333\">You can find the fill list of updates at <a href=\"https://mran.revolutionanalytics.com/news/#rro321\" target=\"_blan